  { q: 'Can I build a second house on my finca in Spain?', a: 'Almost never. On rural land (rústico) a new house is only possible through a separate procedure, with a large minimum plot, and usually only one house per plot. A second, separate house next to the existing one is almost never allowed.' },
  { q: 'Can I put a mobile home or tiny house on my land?', a: 'Not without a permit if it stays there permanently. A mobile home with a fixed spot, water and electricity connections or a foundation counts as a building. On rústico that is generally not allowed.' },
